      "text": "Add the {tomato:plural}, crush them with a spoon and season with a little of the {salt}. Simmer, stirring now and then, until the sauce has thickened but is still loose. Lift out the {garlic} and tear in half of the {basil}.",
      "time": {"from": 15, "to": 20, "unit": "minute"},
      "temperature": null,
      "safety_points": [],
